  "narrative": "Over central France, 11:45Z. On Accent Air ACX143 from Manchester to Nice, an A320 (AX-UNR) with 172 passengers, an intoxicated passenger becomes aggressive towards cabin crew and other passengers and has to be restrained. The commander decides to divert to Lyon and asks for police to meet the aircraft. The passenger and their bags must come off, other passengers want to know what happens next, and the Nice return is waiting. The commander flies and decides the aircraft; the agents prepare the ground.",
